       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DIGITREVERSAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N PIC 9(5) VALUE 12345.
       01 REVERSED PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       01 REMAINDER PIC 9(1).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM UNTIL N = 0
               DIVIDE N BY 10 GIVING N REMAINDER REMAINDER
               COMPUTE REVERSED = REVERSED * 10 + REMAINDER
           END-PERFORM

           DISPLAY "REVERSED: " REVERSED
           STOP RUN.
